            "state": "translated",
            "value": "语音输入与自动插入功能已全部就绪。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voice Buddy runs entirely offline on your Mac. Using local speech recognition and lightweight language models, it turns spoken words into clean, punctuated text in milliseconds without sending any audio or text data to the cloud. Dictation is activated exclusively via your global keyboard shortcut.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voice Buddy runs entirely offline on your Mac. Using local speech recognition and lightweight language models, it turns spoken words into clean, punctuated text in milliseconds without sending any audio or text data to the cloud. Dictation is activated exclusively via your global keyboard shortcut."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voice Buddy 完全在你的 Mac 本地离线运行。通过本机部署的语音识别与轻量语言模型，在毫秒级内将你的语音转化为精准、带有合理标点的文字，全程绝不向云端发送任何音频或文本数据，充分保障你的隐私安全。听写功能完全由你的全局快捷键唤醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voice Buddy supports 4 distinct model architectures tailored to your hardware and workflows: Qwen3-ASR (MLX flagship for Chinese & Chinglish), Whisper Large-v3 Turbo (CoreML 90+ languages), SenseVoice Small (FunASR sub-100ms instant response), and Apple Speech (0 MB built-in instant ready).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voice Buddy supports 4 distinct model architectures tailored to your hardware and workflows: Qwen3-ASR (MLX flagship for Chinese & Chinglish), Whisper Large-v3 Turbo (CoreML 90+ languages), SenseVoice Small (FunASR sub-100ms instant response), and Apple Speech (0 MB built-in instant ready)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voice Buddy 支持 4 类特色声学引擎满足不同硬件与场景需求：Qwen3-ASR（MLX 旗舰中英混说）、Whisper Large-v3 Turbo（CoreML 全球 90+ 语言）、SenseVoice Small（阿里 FunASR 毫秒级极速响应）、Apple Speech（macOS 系统内置 0 下载即用）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voice Buddy works completely offline. Permissions are only used for local audio capture and text insertion.": {
